SUMMARY:Steven Ho: Not Your Comedy Hero Tour
LOCATION:The Comedy Loft of DC\, 1523 22nd St NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Steven Ho is a former ER Technician turned stand-up comedian an
 d content creator whose comedy brings the wild world of healthcare to the 
 stage and screen. Best known for his viral “Tips from the ER” series\,
  Steven has built a community of over 14 million fans across his platforms
 . Steven blends sharp storytelling\, real-life ER chaos\, and the hilariou
 s submissions he receives from his audiences—true hospital stories that 
 range from unbelievable patient moments to “things people definitely sho
 uldn’t put up there.” Between tour stops\, Steven continues to post we
 ekly sketches featuring a cast of recurring fan-favorite characters like B
 etty\, the overly confident Gen Z nurse\, and Nurse Austin\, the gentle op
 timist. His mix of absurdity\, authenticity\, and heart has made him one of
  the most recognizable comedic voices in the medical and online comedy wor
 lds.\n\nPlease note\, there is a 2 item per person minimum in the showroom.
  This can be any combination of food items or beverages. This does NOT incl
 ude items bought in the basement at the Bier Baron Tavern.\n\nAll General A
 dmission seating is first come first serve\, therefore we cannot guarantee 
 seating together. Groups need to be particularly aware of this. We recommen
 d arriving at least 30 minutes to an hour prior to show time for better sea
 t selection.\n\nDoors close 30 minutes after showtime.\n\nTickets are avail
 able at the door UNLESS tickets have sold out.\n\nGuests must be 18+for ent
 ry. Those under the age of 21 will be given wristbands to wear.\n\nALL SALE
 S ARE FINAL. NO REFUNDS. This includes switching of showtimes\, once purcha
 sed all sales are final.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent custom
 ers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to oth
 er patrons.\n\nWe offer sign language interpretation upon request. Requests
